Files and Their Contribution

"bfs.py"

Contains the Breadth-First Search algorithm using a queue and visited set.

"dfs.py"

Contains the Depth-First Search algorithm using a stack and visited set.

"bfs_for_pyspy.py"

Contains the BFS execution code prepared for profiling.

"dfs_for_pyspy.py"

Contains the DFS execution code prepared for profiling.

"profile_bfs.py"

Measures and profiles the performance of BFS.

"profile_dfs.py"

Measures and profiles the performance of DFS.

"bfs_profile.svg"

Stores the generated BFS profiling visualization.

"dfs_profile.svg"

Stores the generated DFS profiling visualization.

"README.md"

Provides project description, objectives, algorithms, execution steps, file structure, and conclusion.

".gitignore"

Contains files and folders that should not be tracked by Git.

